IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il47-nouns`

-- Row il-47, second part, SELF-CONTAINED: this file and il47-tests-044-red.l4 can be removed together without touching the rest of the row. It imports only `Where a reading comes from` from il47-nouns.
-- THE COMMITTEE IN THE LONG-TERM CARE REGULATIONS. National Insurance (Long-Term Care Insurance) (Rules of Implementation and Arrangements on the Choice of a Cash Benefit) Regulations, 5774-2014, amended 5776-2016.
-- Five operative references in these regulations name the "local professional committee" or s 232 of the Law (regulations 2(ג)(1), 3(א) twice, 3(ב), 4(א)); one sound reference (regulation 3(א) to regulation 1) is here as a control.
-- The Law was amended by Sefer HaChukim 2774 (7 January 2019), p. 152: the definition of the committee is struck from s 223 (s 1), the Institute is named where the committee was (ss 2 to 4), and ss 231 and 232 are repealed (s 5).
-- Sefer HaChukim 2774 p. 153, s 7: the Act begins on 27 Iyar 5779 = 1 June 2019 and applies to a claim for a nursing benefit submitted from that day (fork F1 in NOTES.md: the sources read show no saving for earlier claims in ss 5 and 6).
-- The preamble of the regulations cites s 231(ד) among the sections that empower the Minister: that is an enacting-formula citation, not a reference the regulations rely on to operate, and no assertion is made about it here.
-- Every Hebrew line of an official instrument below is typed from the page image. tools/pdfcheck.py checks that each Hebrew word of it occurs in that page's text layer; it does not check digits, punctuation or word order, so those were compared with the page image by eye.
-- A date for which the sources give no answer is NOTHING; there is no REFUSE.

§ `Nouns of a reference in regulation 044`

DECLARE `What regulation 044 names` IS ONE OF
    `the local professional committee`
    `section 232 of the Law, the section that set the committee its functions`
    `the Institute, which the Law now names where it named the committee`
    `no section, because section 232 is repealed`
    `section 225(a1) of the Law, which the amendment writes where section 225B(a) named section 232`
    `the documents and data listed in regulation 1 of these regulations`

DECLARE `A reference in regulation 044` HAS
    `the words are in` IS A STRING
    `the words say they point at` IS A `What regulation 044 names`
    `the Law names today where the words point` IS A `What regulation 044 names`
    `the amendment writes in place of what the words name` IS A MAYBE `What regulation 044 names`
    `the new regime applies to claims submitted from` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `limb (a) was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`
    `limb (b) was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`

§ `Functions`

GIVEN r IS A `A reference in regulation 044`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the reference points at what the Law names today` MEANS r's `the words say they point at` EQUALS r's `the Law names today where the words point`

-- Whether what the words name stands in the Law for a claim submitted on a day. The only answer the sources held give is the day the new regime begins and the days from then on;
-- for an earlier day, and for a reference with no recorded change, the answer is NOTHING.
GIVEN r IS A `A reference in regulation 044`
      claimDay IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the target stands in the Law for a claim submitted on` MEANS
    CONSIDER r's `the new regime applies to claims submitted from`
        WHEN JUST startDay THEN IF claimDay AT LEAST startDay THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

